<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sentrachem cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Sentrachem cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African chemicals firm Sentrachem Ltd said on Tuesday that shareholders should exercise caution when dealing in its shares as an announcement on its Sanachem Ltd unit will be made shortly.</p>
<p>In November last year the firm warned that losses at Sanachem would impact substantially on group profitability in the 1997 financial year.</p>
<p>Sanachem made up 10 percent of Sentrachem operating profits last year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
